/-
ToeFormal/Derivation/QFTGRMinimalWorkingModelRefinementAttemptAfterConservationRetest

Lean-side marker for the QFT-GR minimal working model bounded post-retest
refinement attempt. The attempt consumes the post-retest refinement-packet
result review, adjusts only the authorized weak pairing domain, regularity
assumptions, test-function class, candidate source definition, scope
restriction, and obstruction-accounting dimensions for the toy candidate, and
selects the attempt-result review. It does not rerun conservation, claim source
admissibility, prove conservation, construct a conservation proof object or
witness, claim Bianchi compatibility, derive the semiclassical Einstein
equation, close QFT-GR, validate empirically, authorize public submission, or
promote the master action.
-/

